From ba19b8ccde9855a6b5a0ed2307947ec0bf35ed39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 05:36:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(games): Cyber-Cosmic lobby overhaul + shared cosmic
 background
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- games/layout.tsx (new): fixed cosmic-bg.png viewport layer shared by all
  /games/* routes — Next.js <Image fill> at 55% opacity, darkened with
  obsidian + emerald/purple nebula radial overlays
- games/memory/layout.tsx: stripped duplicate hand-drawn gradient bg;
  cosmic layer now inherited from parent layout
- games/page.tsx: replace all hardcoded light-mode hex values with CSS
  custom properties (--text1/2/3/4, --surface, --bg2/3, --border/2,
  --shadow-sm); add .ms-card glassmorphic class to token panel, stats
  row, progress summary, and all game cards; .game-page wrapper goes
  transparent in dark mode so the cosmic bg shows through; remove JS
  mouseEnter/Leave hover handlers (CSS handles via .ms-card:hover)
- globals.css: add html.dark .game-page { background: transparent } and
  dark mode search input overrides

https://claude.ai/code/session_01Fvf9P159gZWSEyG539H3Kt
