  - All --bg/--surface/--text1-4/--border/--accent/--neon-* vars renamed
  - All glass-bg/glass-border/glass-blur removed
  - borderRadius 8-20 → var(--radius)
  - rgba() accent variants updated to match new 00FFFF/39FF14 palette
- tsconfig.json: exclude cup-clash/ from mindstate TS compilation
- Zero TypeScript errors after changes
